    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_10
    value: <style=title><size=32>BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=22>WILD substitutes for all \nsymbols except Bonus."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_10
    value: "<size=22>- Appears on reels <style=coinColor>1, 3, 5</style> only.\n-
      <style=coinColor>3</style> Scatters triggers the \n  <style=coinColor>Big Crane
      Bonus</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_BLEU
    value: <style=title><size=42>BLEU BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_BIG_CRANE
    value: <style=title><size=42>BIG CRANE BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_WAB
    value: <style=title><size=42>WHACK-A-BLEU BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_POTIONS
    value: <style=title><size=42>POTIONS BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_RPS
    value: <style=title><size=42>ROCK, PAPER, SCISSORS BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_BLEU
    value: "<size=24>- BLEU BONUS is triggered randomly during Base Game play. \n-
      When triggered, there may be reel expansion and/or random reels changed \n  to
      Wild.\n- Maximum reel expansion is up to 9 rows.\n- Maximum number of reels
      changed to Wild is 3 reels. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_BIG_CRANE
    value: "<size=24>- 3 Bonus Symbols anywhere triggers the BIG CRANE BONUS. \n-
      Tap the screen for the crane to drop down and select one of four \n  MINI-BONUS
      games:\n            - Whack-A-Bleu Bonus\n            - Potions Bonus\n            -
      Rock Paper Scissors Bonus\n            - Free Spins Bonus."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_WAB
    value: "<size=24>- Whack the Bleus appearing in and out of the beakers  to win
      multipliers.\n- Look out for Queen Aqua disguised as a Bleu. \n  Catch her 3
      times and win an EXTRA 100x!\n- Continue whacking until 'Game Over' appears.
      \n  Total multiplier is applied to Total Bet."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_POTIONS
    value: "<size=24>- Pick from the potions to win multipliers. \n  There are 'Danger
      Vials' mixed in the selection.\n- After picking a multiplier, take win or gamble
      by picking again. \n- Number of 'Danger Vials' and multipliers both increase
      as the game progresses.\n- If you pick a 'Danger Vial,' there will be an explosion
      \n  and your win will be reduced to 1x Total Bet.\n- Enjoy the thrill! When
      game ends, \n  win the multiplier applied to Total Bet. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_RPS
    value: "<size=24>- Compete against Queen Aqua in a game of Rock, Paper, Scissors.\n-
      Win a multiplier if you win or tie against Queen Aqua. \n- Multipliers get larger
      as you continue to win.\n- Win an EXTRA 100x if you win 5 times consecutively!\n-
      Game ends when you lose 3 times.\n- When game ends, win the total multiplier
      \n  applied to Total Bet."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=24>- Play 5 Free Games in a 6x5 array.\n- During Free Games, there
      is increased probability \n  of the Bleu Bonus being triggered."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>30 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Queen Aqua's Lab
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_EXTRA_BET
    value: <style=title><size=42>EXTRA BET</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_EXTRA_BET
    value: <size=24>- 50% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to trigger the Bleu Bonus
      more frequently.</size>
